### Listar tarefas com token
GET {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/task
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar usuários
GET {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/user

### Criar usuário
POST {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Guigo",
  "email": "guigo@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar tarefas
GET {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/task

### Criar tarefa
POST {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Criar endpoints REST usando Controller e Entity Framework",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Criar usuário inválido
POST {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "emailerrado",
  "password": "123"
}

### Criar usuário com email duplicado
POST {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro Guigo",
  "email": "guigo@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guigo@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar tarefas sem token
GET {{Desafio3API_HostAddress}}/api/task